    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- Fixed an issue causing Maximilien’s Vault cards to not show a full 5 cards.\n- Fixed an issue where the Overwatch League shop was missing from the shop menu.\n- Fixed an issue causing disconnects with the replay system.\n- Fixed an issue where the loot box thumbnails might not appear.\n- Fixed an issue with the switch spawn button not working.\n- Fixed a bug where some skins were incorrectly showing they were available for purchase in the hero gallery.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Heroes",
     "body": "Ana\n\n- Fixed a bug where Ana's Bastet skin was missing from the game.\n\nOrisa\n\n- In a previous update, fixed an issue where Orisa's overhealth would not restore if fully depleted using the Bulwark perk.",
     "dev": null
    }
   ]
